  "hutong_nyc_ly_gap": "Hutong NYC GA4 sevenrooms_booking_complete returns 0 for the whole of 29 Sep to 5 Oct 2025 while sessions ran normally at 4,591 for the week. This is inside the SevenRooms widget tracking outage that began 22 Sep 2025 and did not resume until 15 Oct 2025. The Meta Schedule pixel reads 4 schedules and the Google 'Sevenrooms Booking Complete' action reads 5.0 for the same week, against 7.17 and 32.17 in the two weeks before. Last-year bookings for this venue are unusable for W39 as they were for W38.",
